          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{97}{6k}-\\frac{5}{3k}+\\frac{1}{k}&=\\frac{97}{6k}-\\frac{10}{6k}+\\frac{6}{6k}\\\\&=\\frac{97-10+6}{6k}\\\\&=\\frac{93}{6k}\\\\&=\\frac{31}{2k}\\end{align*}$$",
